249 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (From the chart, it is evident that premium or experiential dining formats such as Fine Dining, Lounge, Pub, and Microbrewery consistently attract higher ratings, suggesting that customers value ambiance and overall dining experience in addition to food quality. On the other hand, quick-service outlets like Paan Shop, Kiosk, and Mess tend to score lower, reflecting their functional rather than experiential nature. These insights can help businesses and stakeholders in the food industry better understand customer expectations, enabling them to design strategies for improving service quality, enhancing customer experience, and positioning their establishments more effectively in the market.)
/E (From the chart, it is evident that premium or experiential dining formats such as Fine Dining, Lounge, Pub, and Microbrewery consistently attract higher ratings, suggesting that customers value ambiance and overall dining experience in addition to food quality. On the other hand, quick-service outlets like Paan Shop, Kiosk, and Mess tend to score lower, reflecting their functional rather than experiential nature. These insights can help businesses and stakeholders in the food industry better understand customer expectations, enabling them to design strategies for improving service quality, enhancing customer experience, and positioning their establishments more effectively in the market.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
