<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The chart displays how different restaurant highlights \(features/amenities\) impact the average customer ratings. Outlets offering alcohol service, valet parking, nightlife, and smoking areas tend to receive the highest ratings \(close to 4.0\), indicating that such features strongly enhance customer satisfaction. Other positive contributors include live music, outdoor seating, home delivery, and buffet availability, which maintain ratings between 3.3 and 3.6.)
/E (The chart displays how different restaurant highlights \(features/amenities\) impact the average customer ratings. Outlets offering alcohol service, valet parking, nightlife, and smoking areas tend to receive the highest ratings \(close to 4.0\), indicating that such features strongly enhance customer satisfaction. Other positive contributors include live music, outdoor seating, home delivery, and buffet availability, which maintain ratings between 3.3 and 3.6.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
