/T (Overall, the data suggests that experience-driven amenities \(alcohol, music, nightlife, valet parking\) have the strongest positive correlation with ratings, while basic or niche services \(self-service, rooftop, table booking not required\) have minimal impact.)
/E (Overall, the data suggests that experience-driven amenities \(alcohol, music, nightlife, valet parking\) have the strongest positive correlation with ratings, while basic or niche services \(self-service, rooftop, table booking not required\) have minimal impact.)
